        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Henry Kee & Son are delighted to offer for sale this attractive 17.5 acre farm, comprising a compact block of good-quality grassland in two large fields.\n\nThe property benefits from a gravel laneway providing access between the fields, while the Eany River forms the western boundary. A unique feature is the small wooded island within the river, which is included in the sale.\n\nInitial offers in writing will be accepted until 5.30pm Wednesday, 9th September 2026, unless previously sold.\n\nEnquiries welcome."
